// ---- Pill-group generalization (Chunk B1 Task 4 follow-up: 9th finding) --
// (NOTE: the `pills` field this section documents has since been renamed
// and reshaped again, into `buybox` — see the "Buy box controls
// generalization" section at the end of this header comment. The history
